{"name":"Flower Girl Dress","hex":"#ede7e6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"flower","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colorful, conspicuous structure associated with angiosperms, frequently scented and attracting various insects, and which may or may not be used for sexual reproduction.","A reproductive structure in angiosperms (flowering plants), often conspicuously colourful and typically including sepals, petals, and either or both stamens and/or a pistil."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put forth blooms.","To decorate with pictures of flowers."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flower"},{"term":"girl","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A female child.","A woman, especially a young and often attractive woman."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To feminize or girlify; to gender as a girl or as for girls.","To staff with or as a girl or girls."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/girl"},{"term":"dress","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put clothes (or, formerly, armour) on (oneself or someone, a doll, a mannequin, etc.); to clothe. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","To put clothes (or, formerly, armour) on (oneself or someone, a doll, a mannequin, etc.); to clothe. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An item of clothing (usually worn by a woman or young girl) which both covers the upper part of the body and includes a skirt below the waist.","An item of clothing (usually worn by a woman or young girl) which both covers the upper part of the body and includes a skirt below the waist."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dress"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flower girl","blocks":[{"text":"A flower girl is a young girl who scatters flower petals down the aisle during a wedding procession."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower_girl"},{"title":"Flower","blocks":[{"text":"Flowers, also known as blossoms and blooms, are the reproductive structures of flowering plants. Typically, they are structured in four circular levels around the end of a stalk. These include: sepals, which are modified leaves that support the flower; petals, often designed to attract pollinators; male stamens, where pollen is presented; and female gynoecia, where pollen is received and its movement is facilitated to the egg. When flowers are arranged in a group, they are known collectively as an inflorescence."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Magnolia_grandiflora_-_flower_1.jpg/330px-Magnolia_grandiflora_-_flower_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower"},{"title":"Girl","blocks":[{"text":"A girl is a young female human, usually a child or an adolescent. While the term girl has other meanings, including young woman, daughter, or girlfriend regardless of age, the first meaning is the most common one."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Young_girl_smiling_in_sunshine_%282%29.jpg/330px-Young_girl_smiling_in_sunshine_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Girl"},{"title":"Dress","blocks":[{"text":"A dress is a one-piece outer garment that is worn on the torso, hanging down over the legs. Dresses often consist of a bodice attached to a skirt."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg/330px-Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dress"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Flower_girl_%28wedding%29.jpg/500px-Flower_girl_%28wedding%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5